  "content": "<p>Konstanz is full of history, charm, and beautiful views — but the iconic Imperia statue truly steals the spotlight at the harbor. A symbol of power, satire, and medieval history, she reminds visitors that Konstanz is anything but ordinary. ✨🌊</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/Konstanz\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Konstanz</span></a> <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/Imperia\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Imperia</span></a> <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/Bodensee\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Bodensee</span></a></p>",
